{"ref":"BDB, פִּקֵּחַ","hw":"פִּקֵּחַ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">פִּקֵּחַ</span></big>  <strong>adj. seeing</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">פ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 4:11\" href=\"/Exodus.4.11\">Ex 4:11</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">עִוֵּר</span>); pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">פִּקְחִים</span>, fig., <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:8\" href=\"/Exodus.23.8\">23:8</a> <em>clear-sighted ones</em> (cf. [<a data-ref=\"BDB, עָוַר\" href=\"/BDB,_עָוַר\", dir=\"rtl\">עָוַר</a>]).","next":"BDB, פְּקַח־קוֹחַ","prev":"BDB, פָּקַח"}